        "line": 1322,
        "text": "moments (dilateField R U) (dilateField R E) X eta = fun i => dilationFactor R i * moments U E (X / R) eta i (with 0 < R); taking U, E for the hatted normalized profile and R = X_R this is the row-by-row scaling, with the paper's x = X/X_R appearing as X / R"
